@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam DefaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam SequenceBoxBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #555555
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #888780
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F1EFE8
skinparam SequenceDividerBorderColor #888780
skinparam SequenceDividerBackgroundColor #F1EFE8
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FAEEDA
skinparam NoteBorderColor #BA7517

title Palestinian Scholarship Hub — Sequence Diagram

actor       User
participant Frontend
participant "Auth API"     as Auth
participant "Scholarship DB" as SchDB
participant "AI Engine"    as AI
participant "Notif. Service" as Notif
participant "Calendar"     as Cal

== Registration & Login ==
User     ->  Frontend : Submit credentials
Frontend ->  Auth     : Validate user
Auth     --> Frontend : Return JWT token
Frontend --> User     : Load dashboard

== Scholarship Discovery ==
User     ->  Frontend : Search + filters
Frontend ->  SchDB    : Query scholarships
SchDB    --> Frontend : Return results
Frontend --> User     : Render scholarship list
User     ->  Frontend : Open scholarship detail
Frontend ->  SchDB    : Fetch full record
SchDB    --> Frontend : Full scholarship data
Frontend --> User     : Display detail (criteria, dates, guide)

== AI Matching Mode ==
User     ->  Frontend : Activate AI mode
Frontend ->  AI       : Send user profile
AI       ->  SchDB    : Fetch all active scholarships
SchDB    --> AI       : Return scholarship list
AI       ->  AI       : Score & rank scholarships
note right of AI : Weighted scoring:\nGPA, language, field,\nexperience, docs
AI       --> Frontend : Ranked results + match % + gap analysis
Frontend --> User     : Display personalized list

== Save Scholarship & Calendar ==
User     ->  Frontend : Bookmark scholarship
Frontend ->  SchDB    : Save to favorites
User     ->  Frontend : Add deadline to calendar
Frontend ->  Cal      : Generate .ics event
Cal      --> User     : Return calendar file (download)

== Deadline Reminder ==
SchDB    ->  Notif    : Trigger deadline check (cron job)
Notif    --> User     : Send email / push notification

== Application Tracking ==
User     ->  Frontend : Update application status
Frontend ->  SchDB    : Write application status
SchDB    --> Frontend : Confirm saved
Frontend --> User     : Show application tracker

@enduml
